WEBVTT

00:16.440 --> 00:20.010
Apparently you can make monsters 
your companions on Level 7.

00:20.010 --> 00:21.160
Really?!

00:24.800 --> 00:26.750
I can't wait!

00:28.210 --> 00:37.140
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

01:55.170 --> 01:57.010
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

01:58.010 --> 02:02.970
<b>Maxing Defense </b>and <b>Tentacles</b>.

02:07.450 --> 02:09.310
Rawr!

02:09.310 --> 02:14.400
I will now explain taming, the new 
feature you've all been waiting for.

02:14.400 --> 02:16.000
First, a word of caution:

02:16.000 --> 02:20.160
not <i>every</i> monster you see 
out there can be tamed.

02:20.920 --> 02:23.700
The ones that can be tamed 
will have a mark above them,

02:21.410 --> 02:22.740
Pero-chan

02:23.700 --> 02:25.490
so look for that.

02:25.490 --> 02:27.780
That's pretty nice of them.

02:27.780 --> 02:31.250
I wonder if there'll be monsters 
that can help you make things.

02:31.250 --> 02:34.580
There are several different 
ways to tame monsters,

02:34.580 --> 02:36.650
like defeating them to make them your ally,

02:36.650 --> 02:38.890
giving them a special item,

02:38.890 --> 02:43.210
completing quests, or 
meeting other conditions.

02:43.210 --> 02:44.950
And...

02:44.950 --> 02:46.740
Ta-da!

02:45.220 --> 03:00.700
<b>Bridge of Bonds</b>

02:46.740 --> 02:52.080
This ring, the Bridge of Bonds, 
allows you to tame monsters.

02:53.240 --> 02:57.480
While there may be a few 
players, a <i>very few</i> players,

02:57.480 --> 03:00.700
who already have monster companions...

03:01.100 --> 03:03.070
That means us, huh?

03:03.070 --> 03:07.820
The Bridge of Bonds allows each 
player to tame only one monster.

03:07.820 --> 03:09.050
Sorry about that.

03:09.050 --> 03:11.970
Aw, man... But I guess that makes sense.

03:11.970 --> 03:16.120
Should we just help out 
the rest of you, then?

03:16.120 --> 03:17.670
I'd appreciate that.

03:17.670 --> 03:19.760
If one of the conditions to tame 
a monster is defeating it,

03:19.760 --> 03:21.350
that might be tough to do solo.

03:21.350 --> 03:25.290
And in the eighth event, 
which will be starting soon,

03:25.290 --> 03:28.320
having a tamed monster will 
give you an advantage!

03:28.320 --> 03:31.560
Do your best to get a good 
monster on your side, everyone!

03:31.560 --> 03:34.920
Bye now! Rawr!

03:34.920 --> 03:36.960
Okay, so, Maple...

03:36.960 --> 03:37.640
Huh?

03:37.640 --> 03:39.680
Would you say our goal as a guild

03:39.680 --> 03:44.840
is for all of our members to tame 
a monster for the eighth event?

03:44.840 --> 03:47.750
Oh, yeah! Good idea! I agree!

03:47.750 --> 03:50.480
We should probably gather info first.

03:50.480 --> 03:53.550
Find out which monsters 
live where, and all that.

03:53.550 --> 03:57.300
We've got a volcano, snowy 
mountains, a desert, an ocean...

03:57.300 --> 04:00.530
There are various biomes in Level 7.

04:00.530 --> 04:02.510
I can't wait to explore it!

04:02.510 --> 04:04.300
I wonder what monsters we'll find!

04:04.300 --> 04:08.050
Maybe I should make some items 
that'll be effective for taming.

04:08.050 --> 04:10.430
So let's each explore on our own at first,

04:10.430 --> 04:13.930
and reach out to each other 
if we need help or advice.

04:14.310 --> 04:17.170
I'll check the other levels.

04:17.170 --> 04:20.720
Things might have changed 
since Level 7 came out.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.160
Okay, got it.

04:23.620 --> 04:26.500
Okay, everyone, let's do this!

04:26.870 --> 04:28.690
Yeah!

04:35.100 --> 04:37.590
So just defeating them 
isn't always the answer.

04:38.140 --> 04:41.730
Well, I guess exploring Level 7 comes first.

04:41.730 --> 04:44.300
I can take my time finding a partner.

04:45.500 --> 04:50.010
Huh, so there are some ghost-type 
monsters you can tame?

04:51.940 --> 04:55.230
Heh, heh... I guess Sally 
wouldn't like that, though.

04:57.080 --> 04:59.520
Why did I just get chills?

04:59.860 --> 05:02.070
<b>Four</b>

05:06.100 --> 05:09.750
<i>I don't think that NPC was here before.</i>

05:10.190 --> 05:11.990
Ribbit, ribbit.

05:11.990 --> 05:14.160
Is there something you want to ask me?

05:14.000 --> 05:14.710
Quest: "Beneath the Fog in a Distant Land"

05:15.150 --> 05:17.860
"Beneath the Fog in a Distant Land"?

05:18.360 --> 05:20.680
Is that a newly added quest?

05:20.670 --> 05:21.210
Quest: "Beneath the Fog in a Distant Land"

05:21.990 --> 05:25.450
Ribbit, ribbit. Very well, I will tell you.

05:26.920 --> 05:29.180
Are you sure you don't mind, Maple?

05:29.180 --> 05:29.910
Huh?

05:29.910 --> 05:31.770
Helping us, I mean.

05:31.770 --> 05:33.260
Sure, it's fine!

05:33.500 --> 05:35.990
I've already got Syrup, anyway.

05:35.990 --> 05:40.480
Besides, as long as I'm with you, I can 
protect you no matter where you go!

05:40.480 --> 05:42.300
Thank you!

05:42.300 --> 05:43.680
We really appreciate it!

05:44.070 --> 05:46.780
What kind of companion would you two like?

05:46.780 --> 05:49.420
I think I want some kind of cute animal!

05:49.420 --> 05:51.650
I agree with my sister!

05:51.650 --> 05:53.860
Okay! Let's do our best to find—

05:57.590 --> 05:59.980
Bear, bear, bear...

05:58.800 --> 06:00.450
They kind of seem rare!

06:00.450 --> 06:01.600
Maple!

06:01.600 --> 06:03.460
Yeah! Let's go after them!

06:03.460 --> 06:06.330
Bear, bear, bear...

06:09.060 --> 06:12.330
Bear, bear, bear...

06:15.880 --> 06:19.230
I don't think we have the speed for this.

06:19.230 --> 06:20.660
What a shame.

06:20.660 --> 06:22.840
They ran so fast.

06:22.840 --> 06:27.700
Hmm... But if I use [Atrocity],
I might accidentally kill them...

06:29.310 --> 06:34.600
Okay, let's head back for now and ask Iz 
if she has any items that might help us.

06:34.600 --> 06:35.780
Okay!

06:40.670 --> 06:42.200
Um...

06:42.200 --> 06:43.440
Are these...

06:43.440 --> 06:44.830
Perfect timing.

06:44.830 --> 06:48.860
I've gained a bunch of new recipes 
since we came to Level 7.

06:48.860 --> 06:51.420
Will these make us move faster?

06:51.420 --> 06:52.350
Yes.

06:52.350 --> 06:55.460
The people in our guild never 
seem to change their gear,

06:55.460 --> 06:59.310
but it's important to choose the equipment 
that's best suited to your environment.

06:59.310 --> 07:00.930
Thank you so much!

07:00.930 --> 07:02.550
Thanks, Iz!

07:02.550 --> 07:06.600
It might not be quite enough in comparison 
to the base level in Level 7,

07:06.600 --> 07:10.140
but if we combine them with 
these potions that raise AGI...

07:10.520 --> 07:12.300
Oh, dear.

07:12.300 --> 07:13.790
What's wrong?

07:14.370 --> 07:17.940
I gave some to Kuromu and the others, 
so now I only have two left.

07:17.940 --> 07:20.040
And I'm out of the ingredients.

07:20.040 --> 07:22.710
Where can you get the ingredients?

07:23.180 --> 07:26.250
Looks like they can be found 
in the ocean on this level.

07:27.110 --> 07:31.080
I'll go get them, then! As our guildmaster!

07:31.080 --> 07:32.900
We'll go with you.

07:32.900 --> 07:34.350
Oh, that's okay.

07:34.350 --> 07:36.910
You two can continue exploring Level 7.

07:36.910 --> 07:38.140
Okay, then!

07:38.140 --> 07:39.680
Thank you!

07:39.680 --> 07:41.600
We'll try our best together!

07:42.630 --> 07:44.780
I'll be back soon!

07:44.780 --> 07:47.020
Take care!

07:48.270 --> 07:50.110
Yui, what should we do?

07:50.110 --> 07:53.840
Explore some other areas 
until Maple comes back?

07:55.840 --> 07:57.270
I just...

07:57.270 --> 07:58.660
...can't help wondering.

07:58.990 --> 08:01.210
<b>West</b>

08:06.120 --> 08:07.770
No marks on them.

08:07.770 --> 08:12.560
So I guess monsters that can be 
tamed are only found on Level 7.

08:12.560 --> 08:13.510
However...

08:13.920 --> 08:16.290
At the bottom of a valley heavy with fog...

08:16.290 --> 08:18.510
That is where you will find it.

08:19.580 --> 08:23.020
I'll tell you the rest 
if you're strong enough.

08:23.020 --> 08:25.740
I felt like there was some 
premonition behind that.

08:25.740 --> 08:27.830
It can't hurt to try.

08:28.140 --> 08:30.630
Here I come! [Arms of the Warrior]!

08:35.820 --> 08:38.790
It comes with the downside 
of lowering our defense...

08:40.550 --> 08:42.780
But that doesn't bother us!

08:43.300 --> 08:45.030
[Destroy Mode]!

08:45.030 --> 08:46.580
Let's go, Yui!

08:46.580 --> 08:47.460
Yeah!

08:56.040 --> 08:57.790
Since Maple isn't here...

08:57.790 --> 08:59.880
...a single hit could be 
enough to take us out.

09:02.400 --> 09:04.350
We have to beat them before they beat us!

09:04.350 --> 09:05.110
Yeah!

09:14.980 --> 09:16.650
What the hell is that?!

09:18.050 --> 09:19.720
What sort of beasts...

09:19.720 --> 09:21.320
N-No, I mean...

09:21.770 --> 09:23.650
Nasty bunnies!

09:26.370 --> 09:29.250
We saw them around here earlier, right?

09:29.250 --> 09:32.210
Yeah. I hope we find them again.

09:35.960 --> 09:36.640
Bear?

09:35.960 --> 09:36.640
Bear!

09:36.640 --> 09:39.260
We finally found them! We'll get them now!

09:39.260 --> 09:40.010
Yeah!

09:48.220 --> 09:49.650
Bear, bear, bear!

09:49.650 --> 09:50.150
There!

09:53.930 --> 09:55.910
Wait! Something's wrong...

09:55.910 --> 09:57.870
Bear!

10:05.490 --> 10:06.970
Let's go, Sis!

10:06.970 --> 10:07.840
Yeah!

10:09.960 --> 10:11.440
Ow...

10:11.960 --> 10:13.190
What?!

10:26.800 --> 10:28.390
It's so pretty!

10:28.390 --> 10:33.240
But even if you can tame fish,
how would you keep them with you?

10:36.100 --> 10:39.200
I wonder if you can tame those, too!

10:39.200 --> 10:40.750
Go after them, Syrup!

10:40.750 --> 10:42.150
T-Turtle?

10:42.150 --> 10:45.880
Don't worry! I'll look for 
the items Iz asked for, too.

10:45.880 --> 10:46.980
Come on, let's go!

10:46.980 --> 10:48.390
Turtle!

10:53.160 --> 10:54.580
We lost...

10:54.580 --> 10:57.330
Come on, Sis! Let's go try one more time!

10:57.330 --> 10:58.160
Yeah!

11:03.300 --> 11:04.670
[Arms of the Warrior]!

11:04.670 --> 11:07.030
[Sixth of Sword - Blaze]!

11:20.180 --> 11:21.450
All right, next.

11:21.950 --> 11:26.170
Nine, and... ten. There!

11:26.530 --> 11:29.050
All right! Mission complete!

11:29.050 --> 11:30.620
I really got a lot!

11:30.620 --> 11:33.630
Syrup, let's head back to Iz—

11:35.530 --> 11:37.550
What?!

11:37.550 --> 11:39.010
Turtle?!

11:39.010 --> 11:40.350
Hey, wait!

11:42.990 --> 11:44.860
[Atrocity]!

12:11.730 --> 12:14.430
Am I inside that weird haze?

12:14.430 --> 12:16.990
Wait! [Atrocity] wore off!

12:16.990 --> 12:20.180
Oh, man, what a waste.

12:25.470 --> 12:26.930
[Devour]!

12:30.060 --> 12:31.280
Wait, wait!

12:31.280 --> 12:32.800
What the?!

12:36.020 --> 12:37.620
Wait a...

12:50.500 --> 12:54.030
I wasn't expecting this quest 
to cover three levels.

12:54.390 --> 12:56.560
It's making me get my hopes up.

12:56.560 --> 12:58.730
Here I come! [Mind's Eye]!

13:01.800 --> 13:06.140
<i>Maybe this is the way Sally sees the world.</i>

13:06.140 --> 13:07.850
[First of Sword - Heat Haze]!

13:10.470 --> 13:12.460
[Fourth of Sword - Whirlwind]!

13:17.350 --> 13:18.350
[Leap]!

13:18.350 --> 13:20.390
[Third of Sword - Lonely Moon]!

13:23.250 --> 13:24.830
[Purple Phantom Blade]!

13:36.330 --> 13:40.060
If not for this, it'd be 
such an amazing move...

13:46.290 --> 13:50.270
And we keep coming so close...

13:50.270 --> 13:52.600
But we end up losing every time.

13:52.600 --> 13:56.970
I wish I could help, but I've 
got my hands full myself.

13:56.970 --> 13:59.470
Oh, no, don't worry about us!

13:59.470 --> 14:03.520
This just makes us more 
fired up to kick its butt!

14:03.520 --> 14:06.860
Oh, could this room be any cuter?

14:07.480 --> 14:09.700
Here, have this, too.

14:14.200 --> 14:15.420
How cute!

14:15.420 --> 14:16.880
S-Sis...

14:18.980 --> 14:20.330
I accept.

14:20.590 --> 14:21.940
Yeah, eat up!

14:22.770 --> 14:26.000
Come to think of it, Maple's taking a while.

14:26.000 --> 14:27.710
How far did she go, anyway?

14:32.140 --> 14:35.810
I didn't think it'd drag 
me down even deeper...

14:35.810 --> 14:37.690
Is this finally the end of it?

14:39.690 --> 14:42.730
Ew, gross!

14:43.540 --> 14:44.860
[Devour]!

15:08.750 --> 15:11.470
Nothing would surprise me here, 
even a devil or a snake.

15:18.260 --> 15:20.720
Is this... paralysis?

15:20.720 --> 15:23.910
No, I think... my movement's been stopped.

15:26.880 --> 15:29.600
I didn't think there'd actually be a snake.

15:32.070 --> 15:33.650
Bear!

15:36.190 --> 15:38.420
We'll save you this time!

15:39.620 --> 15:41.250
Bear!

15:42.340 --> 15:43.580
Sis!

15:49.900 --> 15:52.540
A White Snake... I see.

15:52.540 --> 15:54.710
Right. I like it.

15:54.710 --> 15:56.200
I'll give it one more try.

16:02.200 --> 16:07.060
Okay, it ate me, but I'm not in the 
water, so I can move around freely!

16:07.060 --> 16:08.970
[Deploy Right Hand]!

16:22.130 --> 16:24.490
You shouldn't be such a picky eater!

16:24.490 --> 16:26.580
If you won't eat me, then I'll just eat <i>you</i>!

16:53.890 --> 16:55.320
Again?!

16:58.660 --> 17:00.150
Bear!

17:06.170 --> 17:07.790
You guys, too?

17:07.790 --> 17:09.760
We lost again.

17:09.760 --> 17:11.200
But we won't give up!

17:11.200 --> 17:13.320
Yeah. Let's all do our best.

17:14.750 --> 17:15.800
[Hydra]!

17:22.780 --> 17:25.430
Mm, spicy!

17:26.820 --> 17:29.750
<i>It seems like only blows to its 
forehead are counted as damage.</i>

17:30.120 --> 17:31.760
<i>What to do?</i>

17:32.270 --> 17:33.410
[Blood Blade]!

17:36.620 --> 17:38.970
Still, every time I get close to it...

17:46.580 --> 17:50.140
Wait, is this some sort of 
guardian that can't be defeated?

17:51.300 --> 17:52.610
It's do or die!

17:53.080 --> 17:54.310
[Super Speed]!

17:54.760 --> 17:55.720
[Lonely Moon]!

18:19.800 --> 18:22.930
It was just an idea I 
came up with on the fly,

18:22.930 --> 18:24.590
but it worked.

18:26.110 --> 18:27.810
Now, then...

18:46.680 --> 18:50.280
Ooh, I like this! It's so savory!

19:02.780 --> 19:04.230
Snake?

19:09.070 --> 19:12.580
Will it take to me? Let's see...

19:32.020 --> 19:33.500
Snake?

19:33.500 --> 19:36.420
I'll give you a name. Just be patient.

19:39.450 --> 19:40.070
Yui!

19:40.070 --> 19:41.600
Right, Sis!

19:55.560 --> 19:56.890
Yui!

19:56.890 --> 19:58.260
Sis!

19:58.260 --> 20:00.390
Bear...

20:01.100 --> 20:02.410
Bear?

20:05.920 --> 20:08.290
They're so soft and fluffy!

20:08.290 --> 20:09.940
And warm!

20:09.940 --> 20:12.340
We did it!

20:10.530 --> 20:12.340
Bear!

20:19.580 --> 20:22.240
Aw, it's all gone.

20:22.240 --> 20:25.360
But that was the tastiest 
monster I've ever eaten!

20:26.120 --> 20:28.500
Oh, a new skill?

20:28.500 --> 20:32.320
Let's see... [Invitation to the Ocean Floor]?

20:32.320 --> 20:33.840
I wonder what it does...

20:34.620 --> 20:35.460
What do you think?

20:35.460 --> 20:38.620
Good point. That could be nice, too.

20:38.620 --> 20:40.080
We're back!

20:41.260 --> 20:43.650
Wow, I see you two were successful.

20:43.650 --> 20:45.440
Yes! We did it!

20:45.440 --> 20:46.800
And you, too!

20:47.050 --> 20:50.080
What is your little snake's name?

20:50.080 --> 20:53.090
Haku. Do you think that's too basic?

20:53.090 --> 20:55.040
No, it's adorable!

20:56.280 --> 20:58.970
That just leaves Kanade, Iz, and me.

20:58.970 --> 21:00.980
I have something in mind, actually.

21:00.980 --> 21:01.910
For real?

21:02.300 --> 21:02.730
Oh!

21:02.730 --> 21:06.460
This is perfect timing! 
I have gifts for you two!

21:14.070 --> 21:16.030
Yay!

21:16.310 --> 21:18.750
You really can make anything.

21:18.750 --> 21:21.880
They'll be with you from now on,
so you want them to look cute, right?

21:21.880 --> 21:23.690
Thank you!

21:23.690 --> 21:25.020
Have you chosen names?

21:25.020 --> 21:27.340
Yes! This one is Tsukimi!

21:27.340 --> 21:29.390
And this is Yukimi!

21:29.720 --> 21:31.410
Great names.

21:31.410 --> 21:35.310
I'm glad to know you two and 
Haku, Tsukimi and Yukimi.

21:35.310 --> 21:37.620
Aw, how cute!

21:38.190 --> 21:40.480
Oh, welcome back, Maple.

21:41.240 --> 21:43.970
Y-Your arm...

21:44.270 --> 21:46.140
And your eyes...

21:46.590 --> 21:49.810
I can produce tentacles now!

21:50.980 --> 21:53.010
Been working hard, everyone?

21:53.830 --> 21:55.720
Sally! Welcome back!

21:55.720 --> 21:58.370
Hey, Maple, nice tentacles.

22:02.050 --> 22:10.050
[NWO] Level 7, Thread 1: Tame Monsters [Released!]

22:02.210 --> 22:04.760
Everyone got a monster partner now?

22:02.500 --> 22:04.670
Still checking things out

22:02.760 --> 22:04.670
